  "contentHtml": "<!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">EBS온라인 클래스 과제 게시판에 찍은 사진 올리게 할 때 학생들 안내 자료 입니다.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">아래 글을 편집하셔서 그냥 본문에 넣어 주시면 됩니다.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">사진 용량을 줄이면 한번에 여러장의 사진도 올릴 수 있네요</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><strong><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&lt;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">예시 과제</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&gt;</span></strong></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">집 주변에 화성암</span><font face=\"Gulim\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span></font><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">변성암</span><font face=\"Gulim\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span></font><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">퇴적암을 찾아 촬영하고 촬영한 사진</span><font face=\"Gulim\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">3</span></font><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">장을 순서대로 과학과제 제출방에 올려 주세요</span><font face=\"Gulim\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. - </span></font><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">게시판에 계속해서 이미지 삽입을 하면 됩니다</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt;\"></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">또는 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt;\">&nbsp; </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">집 주변에 암석중 변성암을 찾아서 메모지에 왜 변성암인지 이유를 적어서</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">암석 옆이나 위에 놓고 함께 사진을 찍어서 과학과제 제출방에 올리세요</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">변성암 특징이 잘 나타나게 촬영해 주세요</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt;\"> </span><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><br></p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt;\">&nbsp; </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><strong><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&lt;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학생들에게 제시할 참고 내용</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&gt;</span></strong></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">과제제출방에 올릴때는 첨부화일로 올리지 말고 반드시 이미지 삽입으로 올려 주세요</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt;\">  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">EBS </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">온라인 게시판에 사진 이미지 삽입으로 올리는 방법 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><a class=\"tx-link\" href=\"https://youtu.be/l6Kwm6fFkEE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><u style=\"text-underline: #0000ff single;\"><span  style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><strong>https://youtu.be/l6Kwm6fFkEE</strong></span></u></a></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt;\">  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">최신 스마트폰 카메라로 촬영하면 사진 용량이 커서 올라가다 에러가 나거나</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">멈출 수 있습니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">사진 용량을 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1M </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이하로 줄여서 올려 주세요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt;\">  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">사진 용량이 커서 잘 안올라갈 때 아래와 같은 대처 방법이 있습니다</span><span  style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt;\">  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">1, 스마트폰 전면 카메라 사용 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">그럼 사진 용량이 조금 작아져요</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">스마트폰으로 사진 찍고 갤러리에 가서 화면 캡처 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&#8211; </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">스크린샷으로 저장되며 용량이 줄어요</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">3. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">자기 자신에게 카톡으로 보내고 내려 받으면 용량이 줄어요</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">4. EBS </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">온라인 클래스 전용 카메라 앱을 플레이스토어에 가서 설치하고 촬영해서 올리면 됩니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. (</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">위 방법이 귀찮다면 아래 앱을 설치해서 사용하세요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><a class=\"tx-link\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=air.com.sciencelove.ebscamera\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><u style=\"text-underline: #0000ff single;\"><span  style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=air.com.sciencelove.ebscamera</span></strong></span></u></a></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">EBS </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">온라인 클래스 전용 카메라에서 사진이 촬영되지 않는다면 사용전 반드시 권한 설정을 해 줘야 합니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.** </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">권한 설정 하는 방법은 아래 링크 참고</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">**</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><a class=\"tx-link\" href=\"https://youtu.be/-pnoG8rGRFY\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><u style=\"text-underline: #0000ff single;\"><span  style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><strong>https://youtu.be/-pnoG8rGRFY</strong></span></u></a></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt;\">  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">특히 사진을 여러장 올려 야 할 경우에는 사진 용량을 많이 줄여야 해요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. EBS </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">온라인 클래스 전용 카메라 앱을 사용하면 사진을 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">3,4</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">장 올려도 부담없이 올라 갑니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><strong>&lt;사진 한번에 여러장 이미지 삽입해서 올리는 거 테스트 - 4장&gt;</strong></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99EFC63D5E96B7C52A\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"311\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"99B0D2395E93ED2724.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"311\"  id=\"A_99EFC63D5E96B7C52AFD37\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></span></p><div class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" data-jsonlen=\"20181\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\"><!--[data-hwpjson]{ \"documentPr\": { \"di\": \"\", \"dp\": { \"dn\": \"test.hwp\", \"ta\": 1, \"d1\": 5, \"d2\": 1, \"dv\": 0, \"dr\": 1, \"do\": 1, \"vj\": \"1.1\", \"an\": \"Hancom Office Hangul\", \"av\": \"10, 0, 0, 9015\", \"ao\": \"WIN\", \"ab\": \"32\", \"ar\": \"LE\", \"as\": \"Windows_8\" }, \"dis\": false, \"ds\": { \"ti\": \"\", \"la\": \"ko\", \"cr\": \"\", \"su\": \"\", \"de\": \"\", \"cd\": \"2020-04-15T16:23:09.551Z\", \"md\": \"1601-01-01T09:00:00.000Z\", \"pd\": \"1601-01-01T09:00:00.000Z\", \"